  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia Revenue Authority Institutional Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to develop the capacity of large taxpayer administration in the Zambian Revenue Autority (ZRA) under the Ministry of Finance and National Planning through institutional cooperation between ZRA and Norwegian Tax Authority (NTA) including a mineral taxation expert from the IMF.</narrative>
